{
  "id": "m62l2",
  "title": {
    "es": "Alinear y rellenar",
    "en": "Aligning and padding"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Anchura, alineación y relleno"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Puedes fijar la **anchura** y la **alineación**: `:>10` alinea a la derecha en 10 caracteres, `:<10` a la izquierda, `:^10` al centro. Un `0` antes rellena con ceros: `:03`."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print(f'{42:>5}')",
          "print(f'{7:03}')",
          "print(f'{\"hola\":^10}')"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "   42",
          "007",
          "   hola   "
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Alinear columnas hace que las tablas en consola se lean mucho mejor."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Width, alignment and padding"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "You can set **width** and **alignment**: `:>10` right-aligns in 10 characters, `:<10` left, `:^10` centers. A leading `0` pads with zeros: `:03`."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print(f'{42:>5}')",
          "print(f'{7:03}')",
          "print(f'{\"hola\":^10}')"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "   42",
          "007",
          "   hola   "
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Aligning columns makes console tables far more readable."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m62l1e1b",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `derecha(texto, ancho)` que devuelva el texto alineado a la derecha rellenando con espacios hasta `ancho`.",
        "en": "Define `derecha(texto, ancho)` returning the text right-aligned, padded with spaces up to `ancho`."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def derecha(texto, ancho):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def derecha(texto, ancho):",
        "    return f'{texto:>{ancho}}'"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "f'{texto:>{ancho}}' usa el ancho como variable."
        ],
        "en": [
          "f'{texto:>{ancho}}' uses the width as a variable."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "derecha",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                "ab",
                5
              ],
              "expected": "   ab"
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "hola",
                4
              ],
              "expected": "hola"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m62l2e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `porcentaje(frac)` que muestre una fracción como porcentaje entero (0.25 -> '25%').",
        "en": "Define `porcentaje(frac)` showing a fraction as a whole percentage (0.25 -> '25%')."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def porcentaje(frac):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def porcentaje(frac):",
        "    return f'{frac:.0%}'"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "f'{frac:.0%}'."
        ],
        "en": [
          "f'{frac:.0%}'."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "porcentaje",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                0.25
              ],
              "expected": "25%"
            },
            {
              "args": [
                0.5
              ],
              "expected": "50%"
            },
            {
              "args": [
                1
              ],
              "expected": "100%"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}